<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>license</strong>: Add backward-compatible decryption for legacy key formats on ARM Macs</li>
  <li><strong>updater</strong>: Use Sparkle 2.x API for macOS auto-updates</li>
</ul>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>updater</strong>: Auto-update support via Sparkle (macOS) and WinSparkle (Windows)</li>
  <li><strong>tray</strong>: Tray icon badge and dynamic menu for available updates</li>
</ul>
